'''Bay 2''' was a hangar bay onboard the [[Shield Gate]] [[space station]] that [[orbit]]ed the [[planet]] [[Scarif]]. Immediately before the [[Battle of Scarif]], Bay 2 was undergoing a [[tractor beam]] test.<ref name="Rogue One" />

